<div class="font-sans antialiased text-brand-textDark bg-brand-bg">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="w-full relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[60vh] overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-card/60 to-brand-bg -z-10"></div>
    <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs font-semibold text-brand-olive mb-6">Our Heritage</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-serif text-brand-textDark leading-[0.95] tracking-tight mb-6">
      Returning to<br>
      <span class="italic text-brand-olive font-medium">our roots.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-brand-textLight text-base md:text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Oorvi — Sanskrit for Earth. In a world of processed food, it's a way back to
      our roots, one honestly pressed bottle at a time, from the heart of Hyderabad.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Chapter 01 -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-brand-border/50">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-textLight uppercase block mb-4">Where It Started</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-brand-textDark leading-tight">A return to how<br>oil used to be made.</h2>
          <div class="w-10 h-px bg-brand-olive mt-6"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 space-y-8 text-lg text-brand-textLight leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          <strong class="font-serif text-6xl text-brand-olive float-left mr-4 leading-[0.8] mt-2">M</strong>ost oil on a
          supermarket shelf has been through more processing than pressing — refined, bleached, deodorised
          and blended until very little of the original seed remains. Oorvi started as a rejection of that
          shortcut: a decision to press oil the way it was pressed before "refined" became the default.
        </p>
        <p>
          That meant going back to single-pressing — the first and only pass a seed goes through, with
          nothing added afterward to correct colour, smell, or shelf life. It's a slower, lower-yield way to
          make oil. It's also the only way we were willing to make it.
        </p>
        <div class="w-full h-[360px] md:h-[440px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
          <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-giftset.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi cold-pressed oils, traditionally presented" loading="lazy" width="800" height="500" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Chapter 02 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-textLight uppercase block mb-4">How We Press</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-brand-textDark leading-tight">Native seed,<br>low heat, no shortcuts.</h2>
          <div class="w-10 h-px bg-brand-olive mt-6"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 space-y-8 text-lg text-brand-textLight leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We source A1-grade native variety seed directly from farms we trust, working with growers who
          follow chemical-free, sustainable practices. Cold-pressed lines run through steel expellers kept
          at low temperature; our wood-pressed line runs through a traditional stone-and-wood ghani,
          turning slowly so the seed is never rushed.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-brand-textDark">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-brand-olive mt-1.5 text-sm"></i><span>No refining, bleaching, or deodorising — ever</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-brand-olive mt-1.5 text-sm"></i><span>No blending with cheaper oils to stretch a batch</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-brand-olive mt-1.5 text-sm"></i><span>Naturally settled instead of chemically filtered</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-brand-olive mt-1.5 text-sm"></i><span>Bottled close to the press, not shipped in bulk and rebottled later</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-brand-olive mt-1.5 text-sm"></i><span>Every batch traceable to its certification — FSSAI 23624028002885</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="w-full h-[360px] md:h-[440px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
          <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-kitchen.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi Mustard Oil in a traditional Indian kitchen" loading="lazy" width="800" height="500" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Deep Dive Immersive Section (Dark) -->
  <div class="bg-[#1c1e17] text-[#e8e3d5] py-24 px-6 md:px-12 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 border border-[#a9b889] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-10">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet text-[#e8cf5c]"></i>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-14 max-w-4xl">
        Animate with elegance.<br>
        <span class="text-[#e8cf5c] italic">Extract with patience.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 w-full max-w-5xl text-left">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-white uppercase mb-4 border-b border-[#3b4a1c] pb-4">01. Source</h4>
          <p class="text-[#a9b889] font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">We source A1-grade native variety seed directly from farmers who understand the importance of soil health and traditional harvesting.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-white uppercase mb-4 border-b border-[#3b4a1c] pb-4">02. Settle</h4>
          <p class="text-[#a9b889] font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">Modern oils are chemically filtered for clarity. We rely on gravity — the oil settles naturally instead of being chemically filtered.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-white uppercase mb-4 border-b border-[#3b4a1c] pb-4">03. Serve</h4>
          <p class="text-[#a9b889] font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">We bottle close to the press, never shipped in bulk and rebottled later. Every batch is traceable to its certification.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Campaign Gallery -->
  <section class="bg-[#3b4a1c] text-white py-20 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 mb-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-6 flex-wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs text-[#a9b889] mb-3 font-semibold">From Our Fields</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl">Straight from the source.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#a9b889] flex items-center gap-2">
        Scroll <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto px-6 md:px-12 pb-2 hide-scrollbar" style="scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;">
      <img src="{{ 'campaign-groundnut.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi Groundnut Oil in the field" loading="lazy" width="420" height="560" class="h-[340px] md:h-[420px] w-auto rounded-xl flex-shrink-0" style="scroll-snap-align:start;">
      <img src="{{ 'campaign-safflower.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi Safflower Oil in bloom" loading="lazy" width="420" height="560" class="h-[340px] md:h-[420px] w-auto rounded-xl flex-shrink-0" style="scroll-snap-align:start;">
      <img src="{{ 'campaign-sesame.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi White Sesame Oil at golden hour" loading="lazy" width="420" height="560" class="h-[340px] md:h-[420px] w-auto rounded-xl flex-shrink-0" style="scroll-snap-align:start;">
      <img src="{{ 'campaign-mustard.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oorvi Mustard Oil, rooted in tradition" loading="lazy" width="420" height="560" class="h-[340px] md:h-[420px] w-auto rounded-xl flex-shrink-0" style="scroll-snap-align:start;">
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lookbook grid -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-24">
    <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs font-semibold text-brand-textLight mb-3">The Range</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand-textDark">Eight seeds.<br>Two methods.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4" style="grid-auto-rows:160px;">
      <div class="relative bg-[#1c1e17] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" style="grid-row: span 2;">
        <img src="{{ 'groundnut-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Groundnut Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#e8cf5c]">Groundnut · Cold Pressed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
        <img src="{{ 'sunflower-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Sunflower Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">Sunflower</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
        <img src="{{ 'safflower-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Safflower Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">Safflower</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50" style="grid-row: span 2;">
        <img src="{{ 'coconut-wp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Coconut Oil, Wood Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">Coconut · Wood Pressed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
        <img src="{{ 'mustard-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Mustard Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">Mustard</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-[#1c1e17] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
        <img src="{{ 'black-sesame-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Black Sesame Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#e8cf5c]">Black Sesame</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
        <img src="{{ 'white-sesame-cp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="White Sesame Oil, Cold Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">White Sesame</span>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-brand-border/50">
        <img src="{{ 'groundnut-wp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Groundnut Oil, Wood Pressed" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="h-[78%] w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="absolute left-3 bottom-3 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-olive">Groundnut · Wood Pressed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quality seals -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-20 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs font-semibold text-brand-textLight mb-3">Quality</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-brand-textDark leading-tight mb-6">A true blend of<br><span class="italic text-brand-olive">science and tradition.</span></h2>
      <p class="text-brand-textLight text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">
        Certification here is a seal of record, not decoration — the same marks that appear on every
        bottle, brought forward to where the decision to buy actually happens.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 border border-brand-border/60 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 bg-[#fdfdfa]">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full border border-brand-olive flex items-center justify-center text-brand-olive font-serif font-semibold text-sm shrink-0">FSSAI</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-textLight uppercase tracking-wide">License No.</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-brand-textDark">23624028002885</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 border border-brand-border/60 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 bg-[#fdfdfa]">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full border border-brand-olive flex items-center justify-center text-brand-olive font-serif font-semibold text-sm shrink-0">ISO</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-textLight uppercase tracking-wide">Quality Management</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-brand-textDark">ISO 9000:2015</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 border border-brand-border/60 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 bg-[#fdfdfa]">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full border border-brand-olive flex items-center justify-center text-brand-olive font-serif font-semibold text-sm shrink-0">ISO</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-textLight uppercase tracking-wide">Food Safety</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-brand-textDark">ISO 22000:2018</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Conclusion / Sourcing -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-brand-card flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center border-t border-brand-border/40">
    <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs font-semibold text-brand-olive mb-6">Born in Hyderabad</p>
    <p class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-brand-textDark leading-tight italic max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      "Oorvi isn't just about selling oil. It is about advocating for a lifestyle shift — a return to a
      time when food was medicine, made slowly, and treated with profound respect."
    </p>
    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url | default: routes.collections_url }}" class="bg-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-oliveHover text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-medium transition duration-300 shadow-lg text-sm tracking-wide">
        Shop the range
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
